---
/**
 * 公開identifierの証拠とrelease provenanceを分離して示す。
 * identity manifestを中心に置き、Sigstoreはその生成経路として表現する。
 */
---

<figure class="graph">
  <img
    class="desktopGraph"
    alt="The canonical identity manifest at the center, with Sigstore and SLSA as its release provenance and OpenPGP, public adapters, Ethereum, ENS, and humanity witnesses as separate evidence."
    decoding="async"
    height="520"
    src="/trust-graph.svg"
    width="760"
  />

  <div class="mobileGraph" role="img" aria-labelledby="mobile-graph-title">
    <p class="visuallyHidden" id="mobile-graph-title">
      Evidence graph of my public identity
    </p>

    <div class="mobilePlane">
      <p class="planeLabel">Release provenance</p>
      <p class="planeSource">GitHub Actions OIDC + pinned release policy</p>
      <span class="connector" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="planeNode">Sigstore + SLSA</p>
      <p class="edgeNote">attests exact bytes</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mobileState">
      <strong>Canonical identity state</strong>
      <code>/.well-known/identity.json</code>
      <span>claims + proof registry</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mobileEvidence">
      <p class="planeLabel">Independent evidence bindings</p>
      <ul>
        <li>OpenPGP compatibility proofs</li>
        <li>DNS · WKD · Nostr adapters</li>
        <li>Ethereum · ENS cross-proofs</li>
        <li>Humanity witness · 0 active records</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="caption">
    The manifest names the current identity state. Sigstore proves how that
    state was released; each identifier still requires its own evidence.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .graph {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
  }

  .desktopGraph {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .mobileGraph {
    display: none;
  }

  .caption {
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-2xs);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }

  .visuallyHidden {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (width <= 640px) {
    .graph {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .desktopGraph {
      display: none;
    }

    .mobileGraph {
      display: grid;
    }

    .mobilePlane,
    .mobileEvidence {
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-block: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .mobileEvidence {
      border-top: 0;
    }

    .planeLabel {
      margin: 0 0 9px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: var(--text-2xs);
      color: var(--color-accent);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .planeSource,
    .planeNode,
    .edgeNote {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .planeSource {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-text-strong);
    }

    .connector {
      display: block;
      width: 1px;
      height: 18px;
      margin: 8px 0 8px 12px;
      background: var(--border-accent);
    }

    .planeNode {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text-strong);
    }

    .edgeNote {
      margin-top: 3px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: var(--text-2xs);
      color: var(--color-text-soft);
    }

    .mobileState {
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 20px;
      background: var(--accent-glow);
      border-block: 1px solid var(--border-accent);

      & strong {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        color: var(--color-text-strong);
      }

      & code {
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
        color: var(--color-accent);
      }

      & span {
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
        color: var(--color-text-soft);
      }
    }

    .mobileEvidence ul {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      list-style: none;

      & li {
        padding-bottom: 8px;
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
        color: var(--color-text-soft);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);

        &:last-child {
          padding-bottom: 0;
          border-bottom: 0;
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>
